Or, guess how I got killed yet again?

Would it be asking too much to suggest that maybe, just maybe, if you
get frozen by an eye, and then something (like your pet) kills the eye,
it might break the enchantment?

And maybe Shift-<move> could stop when you move adjacent to a monster
rather than after you've run into it and hit it?  (Yeah, I know running
is dangerous, but it's tediously boring to play a game where you've got
to move each individual step with an explicit command.)  Pretty sure
the ST port (at least) stops one step too late -- and, to make it
worse, it doesn't flush any type-ahead like kinder ports do or used
to.

